return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:05+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:05+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'Yana haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizon WordPress zuwa Zinn Digital® domin a iya wallafa labaran da aka tsara lokaci a ciki. Liƙa lambar haɗawa daga allon sarrafa Zinn® kuma plugin ɗin yana saita nasa shaidar — ba a kwafin komai da hannu.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An adana. Buga sabon ƙima don maye gurbin sa.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan jerin...','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan jerin','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan tace.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara wani sahu','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan sahu','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — taƙaitaccen bayani','Overview'=>'Bayani gaba ɗaya','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane Zinn® plugin a wannan shafin, da kuma ko yana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ba a buƙatar haɗin intanit don wannan plugin ɗin.','Open settings'=>'Buɗe saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ka da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sassan Saituna','Support'=>'Goyon baya','Save changes'=>'Ajiye canje-canje','Tools'=>'Kayan Aiki','Export settings'=>'Saitunan fitarwa','Reset to defaults'=>'Sake wa tsoffin saitunan asali','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai dawo da duk wani tsari a kan wannan plugin zuwa ga asalin saitinsa. A ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Binciken matsala don goyon baya','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saiti','Import'=>'Shigo da kaya','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba sa ƙunshe da kalmomin sirri, alamomi (tokens) ko maɓallan API — za buƙaci ka sake shigar da su a sabon rukunin yanar gizon.','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'An kafa dukkan saitunan da ke kan wannan fagin a matsayin na asali.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Ba a samun wannan matakin.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba za a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saitunan da aka fitar daga wani matosai na Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Waccan fayil din yayi yawa sosai don ya zama fitar da saituna.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba fitarwa ba ce ta saitunan Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da waccan fayil ɗin ne daga wani matosai na daban (%s), saboda haka shigo da ita nan zai adana saitunan da wannan matosai ba ya fahimta ba.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saitin %d. Kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API ba sa cikin fitarwa, don haka a sake shigar da waɗancan.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna %d. Kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API ba sa cikin fitarwa, don haka a sake shigar da su.','The archive would be %1$d MB, over the %2$d MB limit set on this site. Raise the limit, or exclude some folders, on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups screen.'=>'Adana ta taba zama %1$d MB, wanda ya wuce iyakar %2$d MB da aka saita a kan wannan shafin. Ƙara iyakar, ko ware wasu bango, a kan Zinn Digital® → Mai haɗawa → Allon madadin.','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP na wannan shafin ba zai iya ƙirƙirar ɗakunan ajiya ba, don haka ba a iya yin ajiyar bayanai ba.','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'An kasa ƙirƙirar fayil ɗin wucin gadi.','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'Ba a iya adana fayilolin wannan shafin ba.','This site\'s PHP cannot compress archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP na wannan shafin ba zai iya matse kayan adana bayanai ba, don haka ba a iya yin ajiyar waje ba.','A backup of this site needs about %1$s of temporary space and only %2$s is free, so it was not attempted.'=>'Wani ajiyar waje na wannan shafin yana buƙatar kusan %1$s na ɗan lokaci kuma %2$s kawai ke da kyauta, don haka ba a yi ƙoƙari ba.','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'Wannan mai amfani na WordPress ba zai iya buga rubuce-rubuce ba, don haka haɗin da aka yi yanzu ba zai iya bugawa ba ko kadan. Shiga azaman mai amfani wanda zai iya, sannan ka sake gwadawa.','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'An kashe kalmomin sirri na aikace-aikace a kan wannan shafin, don haka ba za mu iya ƙirƙirar takardar shaidar ba. Roƙi mai masaukin baƙi naka ya kunna su, ko kuma ka haɗa shafin tare da kalmar sirri da kuka ƙirƙira da kanka a cikin kundin tsarin mulkin ku na Zinn Digital®.','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress ba za ta iya ƙirƙirar takardar shaida don wannan shafin ba. Ba a tura komai ko\'ina ba.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® daga wannan shafin ba. Babu abin da aka haɗa, kuma an cire shaidar da muka yi. Bincika cewa shafin zai iya yin buƙatun fitarwa, kuma a gwada kuma.','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® bai karɓi wannan lambar haɗin ba. Ba a haɗa komai ba. Samar da sabuwar lamba a cikin allon sarrafa ku kuma sake gwadawa.','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'An haɗa. Zinn Digital® yanzu zai iya bugawa zuwa wannan shafin.','Connected'=>'Haɗe','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa...','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma wani abu na buƙatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Yana gudana a kan asusunka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan plugin din bai fadi dalili ba. A aika da rahoton bincike sai mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗi','Last checked %s ago.'=>'An bincika karshe tun %s da suka wuce.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana buɗe a sabon shafin)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Abin da za a aika ke nan kenan — babu wani abu kuma, kuma babu abin da aka ɓoye. Kalmomin sirrinka, alamomin shiga, da maɓallan API ɗinka ba su ciki.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton binciken da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kwafi zuwa allo','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan rahoton ga tallafin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Mun buɗe tikitin goyon baya don ku kuma mun ba da amsa ta imel. Idan kun fi son kada ku aika da shi, kwafi shi a sama kuma ku liƙa shi a cikin tikiti da kanku.','Copied'=>'An kwafi','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya samun Zinn Digital® ba daga wannan uwar garken (%s). Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti maimakon haka — babu abin da ya lalace a cikin saitunan ka.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An tura rahotonku zuwa ga goyon bayan Zinn® kuma za su ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Taimakon Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonku — lamba ta tunawa %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Ka aika da rahotanni da yawa a cikin dan kankanin lokaci. Jira \'yan mintoci kaɗan sannan ka sake gwadawa — waɗanda suka gabata sun isa.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta kasa karɓar rahoton a yanzu — wannan matsala ce ta ɓangarenmu, ba ta taku ba. Sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba, ko kuma ku kwafe rahoton da ke sama zuwa cikin tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ki amince da rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama sannan a bude tikiti, tare da ambaton wannan lamba.','This site’s owner has turned off image uploads for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Mai wannan shafin ya kasance ya kashe loda hotuna don Zinn Digital® a cikin saitunan Zinn® Connector.','This site’s owner has turned off edits to existing articles for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Mai wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya kashe gyara ga talifofin da ke akwai na Zinn Digital® a cikin saitunan Zinn® Connector.','New article on your site: %s'=>'Sabon labari a shafin ku: %s','Zinn Digital® has added an article to your site.

Title: %1$s
Edit it: %2$s
Status: %3$s

Turn these emails off on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing screen.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya ƙara wani labari a shafin ku.

Taken: %1$s
Gyara shi: %2$s
Matsayi: %3$s

Kashe waɗannan imel ɗin a kan allon Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da siyar da ingantattun shafuka, yanki, da kuma wuraren sanya hanyoyin sadarwa, tare da ajiyar kuɗi cikin aminci har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — hayar mutanen da ke yin wannan a matsayin sana\'a','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta masu zaman kansu ta duniya: bincika sama da sabis 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya wani aikin kuma bari su yi fare.','Connector'=>'Mai haɗawa','Connection'=>'Haɗin yanar gizo','Publishing'=>'Wallafawa','Backups'=>'Tanadi','Advanced'=>'Na gaba','Check the connection now'=>'Bincika haɗin yanar gizon yanzu','Disconnect this site'=>'Cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon','This revokes the credential Zinn Digital® uses, so we can no longer publish to this site. Anything already published stays. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai soke takardar shedar da Zinn Digital® ke amfani da ita, ta yadda ba za mu iya sake bugawa zuwa wannan shafin ba. Duk abin da aka riga aka buga zai tsaya. A ci gaba?','What we may do on this site'=>'Abin da za mu iya yi a wannan shafin','The credential we hold is an ordinary WordPress application password, so WordPress itself decides what is possible. These narrow it further, on your side.'=>'Takaddun shaidar da muke riƙe su ne kalmar sirri ta aikace-aikace ta WordPress ta yau da kullun, don haka WordPress da kanta ce ke yanke shawara abin da zai yiwu. Waɗannan suna taƙaita hakan gaba, a ɓangarenku.','Publish articles as'=>'Bugaje labarai a matsayin','Choose “a draft” if you would rather read everything before it goes live.'=>'Zaɓi "daftari" idan kana son karanta komai kafin ya fita zuwa ga jama\'a.','Published straight away'=>'An buga nan take','A draft, for me to review'=>'Daftari, don in duba','Pending review'=>'Ana jiran Dubawa','Scheduled, using the date we send'=>'An tsara, ta amfani da kwanan watan da muka aika','Show the author as'=>'Nuna marubucin a matsayin','Which of your users appears as the author. This does not change who we sign in as.'=>'Wane ne daga cikin masu amfani da ku ke bayyana a matsayin marubuci. Wannan ba ya canza wanda muke shiga da shi ba.','Put articles in'=>'Sanya labarai a cikin','Allow images'=>'Bada izinin hotuna','Let Zinn Digital® upload images into this site’s media library'=>'Bar Zinn Digital® ya loda hotuna cikin ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai na wannan shafin','Turn this off and articles arrive without their images. Nothing already uploaded is removed.'=>'Kashe wannan kuma labarai za su zo ba tare da hotunansu ba. Ba a cire komai da aka riga aka loda ba.','Allow edits'=>'Bada damar gyarawa','Let Zinn Digital® update an article it published before'=>'Bar Zinn Digital® ya sabunta wani labari da ya wallafa a baya','Used for corrections and re-optimisation. It never touches anything you wrote yourself.'=>'Ana amfani da shi don gyare-gyare da sake ingantawa. Ba ya taɓa taɓa duk abin da kuka rubuta da kanku ba.','Tell me when something is published'=>'Ka sanar da ni lokacin da aka wallafa wani abu','Leave blank for no email. One message per article, from your own site.'=>'Bar a fanko idan ba ka son imel. Saƙo ɗaya a kowane labari, daga shafin ka.','Off-site backups'=>'Ajiyar bayanai ta waje','This site sends its own backup straight to Zinn® storage. Nothing passes through our servers on the way.'=>'Wannan shafin yana aiko da ajiyar bayanansa kai tsaye zuwa ma\'ajiyar Zinn®. Babu abin da ke wucewa ta kan sabar-mu a kan hanya.','Back this site up to Zinn Digital®'=>'Madaukakar wannan shafin zuwa Zinn Digital®','Backup token'=>'Alamar ajiyar bayanai','Set for you when the site was connected. You will only need to touch this if support asks.'=>'An saita muku lokacin da aka haɗa shafin. Za ku buƙaci taɓa wannan ne kawai idan ɓangaren goyon baya ya nemi hakan.','Leave these out'=>'Bar waɗannan a waje','One path per line, relative to wp-content — for example <code>cache</code> or <code>uploads/backups</code>. Caches and other backup plugins’ folders are the usual candidates.'=>'Hanyar ɗaya a kowane layi, mai alaƙa da wp-content — misali <code>cache</code> ko <code>uploads/backups</code>. Wuraren adana bayanai (caches) da kuma babban fayil ɗin wasu abubuwan ajiyar waje (backup plugins) su ne saba da kasancewa mafi dacewa.','Stop if the archive would exceed'=>'Dakatar idan adana ya wuce','Megabytes. A shared host will usually kill a very large archive part-way; a bound turns that into a message instead of a silent failure.'=>'Megabytes. Wani mai masaukin baki da ake rabawa zai kan kasance yana katse babban fayil mai tarin yawa a tsakiya; wani iyaka yana mayar da hakan ya zama sakon gargadi maimakon rashin nasara shiru-shiru.','Detailed logging'=>'Cikakken rajistar ayyuka','Record what this plugin does, for support'=>'Rubuta abin da wannan plugin ke yi, don tallafi','Kept on this site, capped at the last 50 entries, and included in a diagnostics report. Turn it on before reproducing a problem.'=>'An adana a wannan shafin, an iyakance shi zuwa shigarwa 50 na ƙarshe, kuma an haɗa shi cikin rahoton bincike. Kunna shi kafin sake haifar da matsala.','On uninstall'=>'A lokacin cirewa','Delete this plugin’s settings when it is uninstalled'=>'Goge saitunan wannan plugin ɗin lokacin da aka cire shi','Uninstalling never revokes the application password — that is deliberate, so uninstalling to try something else does not break your publishing. Use Disconnect above if you want the credential gone.'=>'Cire shigarwa ba ya soke kalmar sirri ta aikace-aikacen ba — an yi hakan ne da gangan, ta yadda cire shigarwa don gwada wani abu ba zai lalata wallafa ku ba. Yi amfani da Cire Haɗin da ke sama idan kuna son shaidar ta tafi.','The user we sign in as'=>'Mai amfani da muka shiga da shi','The site’s default category'=>'Rukunin shafin na asali','Connect this site again'=>'Sake haɗa wannan shafin','Connect this site'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'Buɗe allo na Zinn Digital®, je zuwa Abubuwan Ciki → Sauran shafuka, sannan ka danna “Get a pairing code”. Liƙe shi a ƙasa.','Connecting again creates a fresh credential and leaves the old one in place — use Disconnect first if you want the old one gone.'=>'Haɗuwa a karo na biyu tana ƙirƙirar sabon takardar shaidar kuma tana barin tsohuwar a wurinta — yi amfani da Cire Haɗin tukunya idan kana son tsohuwar ta tafi.','Pairing code'=>'Lambar haɗawa','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'Yana ƙarewa bayan mintuna talatin da samar da shi, kuma za a iya amfani da shi sau ɗaya ne kawai.','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin haɗa wannan shafin ba.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ba a haɗa wannan shafin da Zinn Digital® ba.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Get a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and paste it below.'=>'Ba abin da ya faru — ba a haɗa shi ba tukuna. Sami lambar haɗawa daga allon sarrafa Zinn® ɗinka kuma liƙa ta a ƙasa.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Buɗe allon kula na Zinn®','The connection is broken.'=>'Haɗin yanar gizon ya katse.','The WordPress user the credential belonged to (%s) no longer exists on this site, so nothing we send can be published. Connect again as a user who can publish.'=>'Wanda mai amfani da WordPress da takardun shaidar ta mallaka (%s) babu ita a wannan shafin kuma, don haka babu abin da muka aika da za a iya bugawa. Sake haɗawa a matsayin mai amfani wanda zai iya bugawa.','The “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password has been deleted from this site, so we can no longer sign in. Connect again to create a new one — nothing else was lost.'=>'An cire kalmar sirrin aikace-aikace ta “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” daga wannan shafin, saboda haka ba za mu iya sake shiga ba. Sake haɗawa don ƙirƙirar sabo - babu wani abu da aka rasa.','See this site’s application passwords'=>'Duba kalmomin sirrin aikace-aikacen wannan shafin','Connected, but publishing would fail.'=>'An haɗa, amma wallafa zai gaza.','The credential belongs to %s, and that user can no longer publish posts. Sign-in still works, so nothing looks wrong until an article is due. Give that user the ability to publish, or connect again as somebody who can.'=>'Shaidodin shiga suna mallakin %s ne, kuma wannan mai amfani ba zai iya sake wallafa rubutacce ba. Shiga yana ci gaba da aiki, don haka babu wani abu da ya bayyana a matsayin kuskure har sai lokacin da za a fitar da wani kasida ya yi. Ba wa wannan mai amfani damar wallafa, ko kuma ka sake haɗawa a matsayin wani wanda zai iya yin hakan.','Edit that user'=>'Gyara wannan mai amfani','Connected here — we could not reach Zinn Digital® to confirm.'=>'An haɗa anan — ba za mu iya tuntuɓar Zinn Digital® ba don tabbatarwa.','Connected, but your Zinn® account needs attention.'=>'An haɗa shi, amma asusunka na Zinn® yana buƙatar kulawa.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'An haɗa zuwa Zinn Digital®.','Connected to Zinn Digital® as %s.'=>'An haɗa zuwa Zinn Digital® azaman %s.','Publishing as'=>'Bugawa a matsayin','Zinn® site ID'=>'ID ɗin shafin Zinn®','This server could not reach api.zinndigital.com (%s). That is usually a firewall or an outbound-connection rule on your host, not a problem with your Zinn® account — publishing may still be working.'=>'Wannan uwar garken ba za ta iya isa ga api.zinndigital.com (%s) ba. Wannan yawanci matsala ce ta katangar wuta ko ƙa\'idar haɗin haɗi ta waje a kan uwar garken ku, ba matsala ba ce tare da aikin ku na Zinn® ba — bugawa na iya ci gaba da aiki.','Zinn Digital® answered with an error of its own — that is our end, not yours. Publishing is unaffected while this clears.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya dawo da kuskuren nasa — wancan na mu ne, ba na ku ba. Buga abubuwa ba zai shafe shi ba yayin da ake gyara wannan.','Your Zinn® account is not currently able to publish to this site. Your dashboard says why.'=>'Asusunku na Zinn® baya da ikon bugawa zuwa wannan rukunin yanar gizon a halin yanzu. Dasbod dinku ya bayyana dalilin.','Zinn Digital® answered HTTP %d, which we do not recognise. Send a diagnostics report from the Support tab and we will look — do not change anything here first.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta amsa HTTP %d, wacce ba mu gane ta ba. A aika da rahoton bincike daga shafin Tallafawa kuma za mu duba — kada ku canza komai a nan da farko.','Check again now'=>'Bincika kuma yanzu','Checked. The connection is live.'=>'An duba. Haɗin yana aiki.','We could not remove the application password, so this site is still connected. Delete “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” on your profile screen and try again — we have changed nothing.'=>'Ba mu iya cire kalmar sirri ta aikace-aikacen ba, don haka wannan shafin yana nan a haɗe. Cire “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” a kan allon bayanan martabarka kuma ka sake gwadawa — ba mu canza komai ba.','Disconnected. The application password has been revoked, so Zinn Digital® can no longer publish to this site. Nothing already published was touched.'=>'Ba a haɗa shi ba. An soke kalmar sirri ta aikace-aikacen, don haka Zinn Digital® ba zai iya sake wallafawa zuwa wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Ba a taɓa komai da aka riga aka wallafa ba.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil din daga wannan uwar garken ba, don haka ba a loda komai ba.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya watsa abin da aka loda ba, don haka ba a tura komai ba.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Wannan fayil din %1$s ne kuma PHP na wannan shafin ba shi da cURL, don haka mafi girman abin da zai iya lodawa shine %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Ba a iya kammala lodawa ba.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Ajiya ta ki amincewa da loda (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Tsarin salo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Wani abin farawa. Duk wani abu da ke ƙasa shi ne zai yi rinjaye.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girmangu na kaina','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma ana amfani da saitaccen tsari yadda yake ainihi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta gaza gwajin inganci kuma ba a sanya ta ba.']];